    - Private keys (PRIVATE KEY.*BEGIN)
    - API keys (api_key.*=)
    - Secrets (secret.*=)
    - Passwords (password.*=)
    - OAuth/Bearer tokens (oauth|bearer.*token)
    - Google secrets (google.*secret)
    - AWS credentials (via aws-secrets)
    - High-entropy strings (TruffleHog)
    
