    - Workflow version-controlled (.github/workflows/secret-scanning.yml)
    - Declarative YAML pipeline (immutable)
    - Idempotent execution (safe to run multiple times)
    - Automated triggers (push, PR, schedule)
    
    Prevents:
    - Accidental secret commits to repository
    - Unauthorized API key exposure
    - Token leaks to public repositories
    - Database password commits
    
